00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Gnomeo & Juliet is a 2011 animated romantic
comedy film directed by Kelly Asbury.

13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
It is loosely based on the play Romeo and Juliet, and features the voices of James McAvoy, Emily Blunt, Michael Caine, Maggie Smith, Jason Statham, Patrick
Stewart, Ashley Jensen, Stephen Merchant, Matt Lucas, Jim Cummings, Julie Walters, Richard Wilson, Ozzy Osbourne, Dolly Parton, and Hulk Hogan.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
The story follows Gnomeo and Juliet, a pair of garden gnomes who fall in love, but due to the feud between
their respective families, they must find a way to keep their blossoming romance a secret.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Gnomeo & Juliet premiered at the El Capitan Theatre in Hollywood on
January 23, 2011, and was theatrically released on February 11.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed
$193 million on a $36 million budget.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
It received nominations for four Annie Awards.

18
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
The song "Hello Hello" by Elton John and Lady Gaga was nominated for the Golden Globe award,
the Satellite Award, and the Critics' Choice Award for Best Original Song.

19
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
A sequel, Sherlock Gnomes, was released in 2018.

20
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film explores themes of garden, villain, forbidden
love, kiss, based on play or musical.
